      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Improved dislocation mobilization and crack arrest will cause the predicted increase in room-temperature ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoscale size and stability of the precipitates will preserve the BCC matrix's high-temperature strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 1600 °C, the mechanical performance of Hf-modified NbMoTaW will remain comparable to untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-enriched secondary phases will remain stable under irradiation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The secondary phases will not act as additional irradiation-defect sinks.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf modification will not compromise NbMoTaW's irradiation resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
